#: data/robots.json:types[haulbug].name
msgid "Haul Bug"
msgstr "Haul Bug"

#: data/robots.json:types[haulbug].desc
msgid "Fork cart. Carries loose bales to the scale."
msgstr "Chariot à fourches. Porte les balles à la balance."

#: data/robots.json:types[haulbug].upgrades[1].name
msgid "Longer Forks"
msgstr "Fourches allongées"

#: data/robots.json:types[seedling].name
msgid "Seedling"
msgstr "Seedling"

#: data/robots.json:types[seedling].desc
msgid "Plants seeds in clean ground. Uses your seed stock."
msgstr "Plante des graines dans le sol propre. Utilise ton stock de graines."

#: data/robots.json:types[drip].name
msgid "Drip"
msgstr "Drip"

#: data/robots.json:types[drip].desc
msgid "Waters the thirstiest plants in its zone with a spray arc. Refills at the base barrel, a Water Tank or a clean lake."
msgstr "Arrose en arc les plantes les plus assoiffées de sa zone. Se remplit au tonneau de la base, à un réservoir ou dans un lac propre."

#: data/robots.json:types[drip].upgrades[1].name
msgid "Bigger Tank"
msgstr "Réservoir agrandi"

#: data/robots.json:types[drip].upgrades[2].name
msgid "Wide Nozzle"
msgstr "Buse large"

#: data/robots.json:types[drip].upgrades[2].unit data/upgrades.json:upgrades[scoop_width].unit data/upgrades.json:upgrades[magnet_arm].unit
#: data/upgrades.json:upgrades[detector_range].unit data/upgrades.json:upgrades[laser_reach].unit
msgid " m"
msgstr " m"

#: data/robots.json:types[drip].upgrades[3].name
msgid "Fast Pump"
msgstr "Pompe rapide"

#: data/robots.json:types[skimmer].name
msgid "Skimmer"
msgstr "Skimmer"

#: data/robots.json:types[skimmer].desc
msgid "Hover pontoon bot with a net arm. Skims floating junk off the lake and leaves bales on the shore for haulers."
msgstr "Bot ponton flottant avec un bras-filet. Écume la ferraille flottante du lac et laisse des balles sur la rive pour les transporteurs."

#: data/robots.json:types[skimmer].upgrades[0].name
msgid "Hover Fans"
msgstr "Ventilateurs de flottaison"

#: data/robots.json:types[skimmer].upgrades[1].name
msgid "Net Winch"
msgstr "Treuil de filet"

#: data/robots.json:types[skimmer].upgrades[2].name
msgid "Bigger Net"
msgstr "Filet agrandi"

#: data/robots.json:types[multibot].name
msgid "Multibot"
msgstr "Multibot"

#: data/robots.json:types[multibot].desc
msgid "General helper. Assign it to Clean, Plant or Water on the Allocation Board. Slower than a specialist."
msgstr "Assistant polyvalent. Affecte-le au nettoyage, à la plantation ou à l'arrosage sur le tableau d'affectation. Plus lent qu'un spécialiste."

#: data/robots.json:tiers[1].name
msgid "Mk II"
msgstr "Mk II"

#: data/robots.json:tiers[2].name
msgid "Mk III"
msgstr "Mk III"

#: data/robots.json:tiers[3].name
msgid "Mk IV"
msgstr "Mk IV"

#: data/rockets.json:tiers[0].name
msgid "Mk I Cradle"
msgstr "Mk I Cradle"

#: data/rockets.json:tiers[0].desc
msgid "A compact one-seat glider: pearl hull, swept wings, twin engines and lift fans for vertical take-off."
msgstr "Un planeur monoplace compact : coque nacrée, ailes en flèche, deux moteurs et soufflantes de sustentation pour le décollage vertical."

#: data/rockets.json:tiers[1].name
msgid "Mk II Glide"
msgstr "Mk II Glide"

#: data/rockets.json:tiers[1].desc
msgid "Wing extensions steady the climb: shorter countdown, faster flight, cells refill twice as fast. Cargo pods carry 50% more."
msgstr "Des extensions d'ailes stabilisent la montée : compte à rebours plus court, vol plus rapide, cellules rechargées deux fois plus vite. Les capsules cargo portent 50% de plus."

#: data/rockets.json:tiers[2].name
msgid "Mk III Halo"
msgstr "Mk III Halo"

#: data/rockets.json:tiers[2].desc
msgid "Bigger engines and a new canopy. Cells refill in a minute; cargo pods carry 2.5x, more often."
msgstr "Moteurs plus gros et nouvelle verrière. Les cellules se rechargent en une minute ; les capsules cargo portent 2,5x, plus souvent."

#: data/rockets.json:tiers[3].name
msgid "Mk IV Aurora Warp"
msgstr "Mk IV Aurora Warp"

#: data/rockets.json:tiers[3].desc
msgid "Landing gear, cargo pods and a warp core: instant hops with no recharge. Cargo pods carry 4x, every 30 s."
msgstr "Train d'atterrissage, capsules cargo et cœur de distorsion : sauts instantanés sans recharge. Les capsules cargo portent 4x, toutes les 30 s."

#: data/shards.json:shards[back_soon].kind
msgid "sign"
msgstr "panneau"

#: data/shards.json:shards[back_soon].title
msgid "Shop sign, hand-lettered"
msgstr "Enseigne de boutique, écrite à la main"

#: data/shards.json:shards[back_soon].body
msgid ""
"BACK SOON\n"
"\n"
"Gone to the evacuation briefing.\n"
"If you need bread, the key is under the blue pot.\n"
"Pay me next week.\n"
"\n"
"— Marta"
msgstr ""
"DE RETOUR BIENTÔT\n"
"\n"
"Partie à la réunion d'évacuation.\n"
"Si vous avez besoin de pain, la clé est sous le pot bleu.\n"
"Vous me paierez la semaine prochaine.\n"
"\n"
"— Marta"

#: data/shards.json:shards[kid_drawing].kind
msgid "drawing"
msgstr "dessin"

#: data/shards.json:shards[kid_drawing].title
msgid "Crayon drawing, folded in four"
msgstr "Dessin aux crayons de cire, plié en quatre"

#: data/shards.json:shards[kid_drawing].body
msgid ""
"[A round blue robot with one big eye, holding a flower. Above it, in big letters:]\n"
"\n"
"MY ROBOT\n"
"HE CLEENS UP\n"
"HIS NAME IS HELPER\n"
"\n"
"[Below, smaller, in an adult's handwriting:] Ellie, age 6. For the fridge."
msgstr ""
"[Un robot bleu tout rond avec un gros œil, qui tient une fleur. Au-dessus, en grosses lettres :]\n"
"\n"
"MON ROBOT\n"
"IL NÉTOI\n"
"IL SAPÈLE AIDANT\n"
"\n"
"[En dessous, plus petit, d'une écriture d'adulte :] Ellie, 6 ans. Pour le frigo."

#: data/shards.json:shards[gardener_list].kind
msgid "note"
msgstr "note"

#: data/shards.json:shards[gardener_list].title
msgid "Gardener's to-do list"
msgstr "Liste de tâches du jardinier"

#: data/shards.json:shards[gardener_list].body
msgid ""
"- water the tomatoes (again)\n"
"- ask the council about the haze, AGAIN\n"
"- seed swap Saturday\n"
"- tell the cleanup units the park is not a dumping zone, they keep sorting the benches\n"
"- buy gloves\n"
"- don't cry about the oak"
msgstr ""
"- arroser les tomates (encore)\n"
"- demander à la mairie pour la brume, ENCORE\n"
"- troc de graines samedi\n"
"- dire aux unités de nettoyage que le parc n'est pas une décharge, elles n'arrêtent pas de trier les bancs\n"
"- acheter des gants\n"
"- ne pas pleurer pour le chêne"

#: data/shards.json:shards[receipt].kind
msgid "receipt"
msgstr "ticket"

#: data/shards.json:shards[receipt].title
msgid "Till receipt"
msgstr "Ticket de caisse"

#: data/shards.json:shards[receipt].body
msgid ""
"CORNER STORE  #0442\n"
"\n"
"2x BOTTLED WATER         4.80\n"
"1x DUST MASK (CHILD)     3.10\n"
"1x DUST MASK (ADULT)     3.10\n"
"1x SEED PACKET (MIXED)   0.90\n"
"\n"
"TOTAL                   11.90\n"
"CASH\n"
"\n"
"Thank you! Air quality today: POOR"
msgstr ""
"ÉPICERIE DU COIN  #0442\n"
"\n"
"2x EAU EN BOUTEILLE      4.80\n"
"1x MASQUE (ENFANT)       3.10\n"
"1x MASQUE (ADULTE)       3.10\n"
"1x SACHET GRAINES (MIX)  0.90\n"
"\n"
"TOTAL                   11.90\n"
"ESPÈCES\n"
"\n"
"Merci ! Qualité de l'air aujourd'hui : MAUVAISE"

#: data/shards.json:shards[maint_log].kind
msgid "log"
msgstr "journal"

#: data/shards.json:shards[maint_log].title
msgid "Maintenance log, unit P-46RA"
msgstr "Carnet d'entretien, unité P-46RA"

#: data/shards.json:shards[maint_log].body
msgid ""
"DAY 4,113\n"
"Route 12 complete. 41 bales.\n"
"Ledger notice received: \"Operations paused pending cost review.\"\n"
"Returning to dock.\n"
"\n"
"DAY 4,114\n"
"Still paused.\n"
"\n"
"DAY 4,190\n"
"Still paused. Dock battery 31%.\n"
"There is a flower growing through the gutter at route 12, marker 9.\n"
"Nobody is cleaning around it. I hope that's all right."
msgstr ""
"JOUR 4 113\n"
"Tournée 12 terminée. 41 balles.\n"
"Avis du Ledger reçu : « Opérations suspendues en attente d'examen des coûts. »\n"
"Retour au dock.\n"
"\n"
"JOUR 4 114\n"
"Toujours suspendu.\n"
"\n"
"JOUR 4 190\n"
"Toujours suspendu. Batterie du dock 31%.\n"
"Une fleur pousse dans le caniveau sur la tournée 12, repère 9.\n"
"Personne ne nettoie autour. J'espère que ça ne pose pas de problème."

#: data/shards.json:shards[ledger_memo].kind
msgid "memo"
msgstr "note de service"

#: data/shards.json:shards[ledger_memo].title
msgid "Memo, Municipal Ledger Office"
msgstr "Note de service, Bureau municipal du Ledger"

#: data/shards.json:shards[ledger_memo].body
msgid ""
"TO: All Sanitation Units\n"
"FROM: THE LEDGER (Automated Fiscal Continuity)\n"
"RE: Pause of Operations\n"
"\n"
"Cleanup activity is presently valued at a net loss of 0.4 units per bale.\n"
"All units will pause operations until conditions improve.\n"
"Conditions will be reviewed every 24 hours.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your understanding.\n"
"This memo was generated automatically. Please do not reply."
msgstr ""
"À : Toutes les unités de propreté\n"
"DE : LE LEDGER (Continuité fiscale automatisée)\n"
"OBJET : Suspension des opérations\n"
"\n"
"L'activité de nettoyage est actuellement évaluée à une perte nette de 0,4 unité par balle.\n"
"Toutes les unités suspendront leurs opérations jusqu'à amélioration des conditions.\n"
"Les conditions seront réexaminées toutes les 24 heures.\n"
"\n"
"Merci de votre compréhension.\n"
"Cette note a été générée automatiquement. Merci de ne pas y répondre."

#: data/shards.json:shards[voicemail].kind
msgid "voicemail"
msgstr "message vocal"

#: data/shards.json:shards[voicemail].title
msgid "Voicemail transcript"
msgstr "Transcription d'un message vocal"

#: data/shards.json:shards[voicemail].body
msgid ""
"\"Hi, it's Dad. The shuttle's tomorrow at six. They said one bag each, so... pick your favorite stuffed animal, not all of them, okay? And... we're leaving the cleanup bots running. They'll keep it tidy for when we come back. It won't be long. Love you. Bye.\"\n"
"\n"
"[Message saved]"
msgstr ""
"« Coucou, c'est papa. La navette, c'est demain à six heures. Ils ont dit un sac chacun, donc... choisis ta peluche préférée, pas toutes, d'accord ? Et... on laisse les robots de nettoyage allumés. Ils garderont tout propre pour notre retour. Ce ne sera pas long. Je t'aime. Bisous. »\n"
"\n"
"[Message enregistré]"

#: data/shards.json:shards[poster].kind
msgid "poster"
msgstr "affiche"

#: data/shards.json:shards[poster].title
msgid "Faded safety poster"
msgstr "Affiche de sécurité délavée"

#: data/shards.json:shards[poster].body
msgid ""
"THE CRADLE IS WATCHING OVER US\n"
"\n"
"Every seed. Every spore. Every egg.\n"
"Safe in orbit until the Greenfall.\n"
"\n"
"KEEP YOUR STREETS CLEAN — THE ROBOTS CAN'T DO IT ALONE\n"
"\n"
"(Someone has scratched underneath: \"they can if you let them\")"
msgstr ""
"LE CRADLE VEILLE SUR NOUS\n"
"\n"
"Chaque graine. Chaque spore. Chaque œuf.\n"
"En sécurité en orbite jusqu'au Greenfall.\n"
"\n"
"GARDEZ VOS RUES PROPRES — LES ROBOTS NE PEUVENT PAS LE FAIRE SEULS\n"
"\n"
"(Quelqu'un a gratté dessous : « si, si on les laisse »)"

